L-09-232145","rule_title":"RHEL 9 /etc/passwd- file must be group-owned by root.","fix_text":"Change the group of the file /etc/passwd- to root by running the following command:\n\n$ sudo chgrp root /etc/passwd-","weight":"10.0","check_content":"Verify the group ownership of the \"/etc/passwd-\" file with the following command:\n\n$ sudo stat -c \"%G %n\" /etc/passwd-\n\nroot /etc/passwd-\n\nIf \"/etc/passwd-\" file does not have a group owner of \"root\", this is a finding.","check_content_ref":{"href":"U_RHEL_9_V2R9_STIG.zip","name":"M"},"classification":"Unclassified","discussion":"The \"/etc/passwd-\" file is a backup file of \"/etc/passwd\", and as such, contains information about the users that are configured on the system. Protection of this file is critical for system security.","false_positives":"","false_negatives":"","documentable":"false","security_override_guidance":"","potential_impacts":"","third_party_tools":"","ia_controls":"DPMS Target Red Hat Enterprise Linux 9DISADPMS TargetRed Hat Enterprise Linux 95551","responsibility":"","mitigations":"","mitigation_control":"","legacy_ids":[],"ccis":["CCI-000366"],"reference_identifier":"","uuid":"6348231a-631e-4c35-a6d5-2dfb41ff918f","stig_uuid":"60b479aa-95a2-4ee3-8e16-aacb5df86c87","status":"not_reviewed","overrides":{},"comments":"","finding_details":"","srg_id":""},{"group_id_src":"V-257910","group_tree":[{"id":"V-257910","title":"SRG-OS-000480-GPOS-00227","description":"<GroupDescription></GroupDescription>"}],"group_id":"V-257910","severity":"medium","group_title":"SRG-OS-000480-GPOS-00227","rule_id_src":"SV-257910r991589_rule_rule","rule_id":"SV-257910r991589_rule","rule_version":"RHEL-09-232150","rule_title":"RHEL 9 /etc/shadow file must be owned by root.","fix_text":"Change the owner of the file /etc/shadow to root by running the following command:\n\n$ sudo chown root /etc/shadow","weight":"10.0","check_content":"Verify the ownership of the \"/etc/shadow\" file with the following command:\n\n$ sudo stat -c \"%U %n\" /etc/shadow\n\nroot /etc/shadow\n\nIf \"/etc/shadow\" file does not have an owner of \"root\", this is a finding.","check_content_ref":{"href":"U_RHEL_9_V2R9_STIG.zip","name":"M"},"classification":"Unclassified","discussion":"The \"/etc/shadow\" file contains the list of local system accounts and stores password hashes. Protection of this file is critical for system security. Failure to give ownership of this file to root provides the designated owner with access to sensitive information, which could weaken the system security posture.","false_positives":"","false_negatives":"","documentable":"false","security_override_guidance":"","potential_impacts":"","third_party_tools":"","ia_controls":"DPMS Target Red Hat Enterprise Linux 9DISADPMS TargetRed Hat Enterprise Linux 95551","responsibility":"","mitigations":"","mitigation_control":"","legacy_ids":[],"ccis":["CCI-000366"],"reference_identifier":"","uuid":"62be0f5d-953e-4f06-a6b5-38e99b796e47","stig_uuid":"60b479aa-95a2-4ee3-8e16-aacb5df86c87","status":"not_reviewed","overrides":{},"comments":"","finding_details":"","srg_id":""},{"group_id_src":"V-257911","group_tree":[{"id":"V-257911","title":"SRG-OS-000480-GPOS-00227","description":"<GroupDescription></GroupDescription>"}],"group_id":"V-257911","severity":"medium","group_title":"SRG-OS-000480-GPOS-00227","rule_id_src":"SV-257911r991589_rule_rule","rule_id":"SV-257911r991589_rule","rule_version":"RHEL-09-232155","rule_title":"RHEL 9 /etc/shadow file must be group-owned by root.","fix_text":"Change the group of the file /etc/shadow to root by running the following command:\n\n$ sudo chgrp root /etc/shadow","weight":"10.0","check_content":"Verify the group ownership of the \"/etc/shadow\" file with the following command:\n\n$ sudo stat -c \"%G %n\" /etc/shadow \n\nroot /etc/shadow\n\nIf \"/etc/shadow\" file does not have a group owner of \"root\", this is a finding.","check_content_ref":{"href":"U_RHEL_9_V2R9_STIG.zip","name":"M"},"classification":"Unclassified","discussion":"The \"/etc/shadow\" file stores password hashes. Protection of this file is critical for system security.","false_positives":"","false_negatives":"","documentable":"false","security_override_guidance":"","potential_impacts":"","third_party_tools":"","ia_controls":"DPMS Target Red Hat Enterprise Linux 9DISADPMS TargetRed Hat Enterprise Linux 95551","responsibility":"","mitigations":"","mitigation_control":"","legacy_ids":[],"ccis":["CCI-000366"],"reference_identifier":"","uuid":"f559ce45-c8f6-4e3b-99e8-a43dd880b146","stig_uuid":"60b479aa-95a2-4ee3-8e16-aacb5df86c87","status":"not_reviewed","overrides":{},"comments":"","finding_details":"","srg_id":""},{"group_id_src":"V-257912","group_tree":[{"id":"V-257912","title":"SRG-OS-000480-GPOS-00227","description":"<GroupDescription></GroupDescription>"}],"group_id":"V-257912","severity":"medium","group_title":"SRG-OS-000480-GPOS-00227","rule_id_src":"SV-257912r991589_rule_rule","rule_id":"SV-257912r991589_rule","rule_version":"RHEL-09-232160","rule_title":"RHEL 9 /etc/shadow- file must be owned by root.","fix_text":"Change the owner of the file /etc/shadow- to root by running the following command:\n\n$ sudo chown root /etc/shadow-","weight":"10.0","check_content":"Verify the ownership of the \"/etc/shadow-\" file with the following command:\n\n$ sudo stat -c \"%U %n\" /etc/shadow- \n\nroot /etc/shadow- \n\nIf \"/etc/shadow-\" file does not have an owner of \"root\", this is a finding.","check_content_ref":{"href":"U_RHEL_9_V2R9_STIG.zip","name":"M"},"classification":"Unclassified","discussion":"The \"/etc/shadow-\" file is a backup file of \"/etc/shadow\", and as such, contains the list of local system accounts and password hashes. Protection of this file is critical for system security.","false_positives":"","false_negatives":"","documentable":"false","security_override_guidance":"","potential_impacts":"","third_party_tools":"","ia_controls":"DPMS Target Red Hat Enterprise Linux 9DISADPMS Targ